{"seq":1,"slug":"antenna-parameters","title":"天线基本参数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/antennas/antenna-parameters","wordCount":1567,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"天线基本参数\">天线基本参数</h1><p>天线是把导线里的电流和自由空间里的电磁波互相转换的换能器。在它之前的所有<a href=\"../rf-circuits/lna-pa\">射频电路</a>都在与电压电流打交道，到了天线，物理图景突变为辐射场。要评价一根天线好不好，不能只看<a href=\"../rf-fundamentals/s-parameters\">S 参数</a>里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——那只说明能量是否进了天线，却没说能量被辐射到了哪里、有多集中、是否被白白损耗。本节建立一套描述天线辐射行为的标准参数：方向图、增益、极化、带宽与有效面积，它们是后续讨论<a href=\"antenna-types\">天线类型</a>与<a href=\"arrays-beamforming\">阵列</a>的共同语言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>天线参数分两类：一类描述「能量是否进得来」（输入阻抗、回波损耗、带宽），与前面的匹配理论一脉相承；另一类描述「能量去了哪、有多集中」（方向图、方向性、增益、极化），是天线独有的辐射特性。连接两者的桥梁是辐射效率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>：进入天线的功率有多少真正辐射出去、多少被欧姆损耗与介质损耗吃掉。增益与方向性的关系由效率联系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = \\eta \\cdot D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是方向性（纯几何的能量集中度），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是增益（计入损耗后实际的集中度）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[馈线送入功率] --&gt; B[输入匹配&lt;br/&gt;S11 决定进得来多少]&#10;    B --&gt; C[天线]&#10;    C --&gt;|辐射效率 eta| D[辐射功率]&#10;    C --&gt;|损耗| E[欧姆/介质损耗]&#10;    D --&gt; F[方向图&lt;br/&gt;能量空间分布]&#10;    F --&gt; G[方向性 D]&#10;    G --&gt;|乘 eta| H[增益 G = eta D]\">flowchart TD\n    A[馈线送入功率] --&gt; B[输入匹配&lt;br/&gt;S11 决定进得来多少]\n    B --&gt; C[天线]\n    C --&gt;|辐射效率 eta| D[辐射功率]\n    C --&gt;|损耗| E[欧姆/介质损耗]\n    D --&gt; F[方向图&lt;br/&gt;能量空间分布]\n    F --&gt; G[方向性 D]\n    G --&gt;|乘 eta| H[增益 G = eta D]</pre><h2 id=\"方向图-方向性与增益\">方向图、方向性与增益</h2><p>天线方向图是辐射强度随空间角度的分布，通常画成极坐标。它由主瓣（能量最集中的方向）、副瓣（旁边的次峰）和零点构成。两个关键的图形指标是半功率波束宽度（主瓣下降到一半功率即 −3 dB 处的张角）和前后比（主瓣与背瓣的比值）。方向性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 定量描述主瓣相对各向同性辐射的集中倍数，定义为最大辐射强度与平均辐射强度之比。增益则是方向性打了效率折扣的实际值，常以 dBi（相对各向同性天线）表示，有时也用 dBd（相对半波偶极子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>dBd</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.15</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>dBi</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\,\\text{dBd}\\approx2.15\\,\\text{dBi}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dBd</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dBi</span></span></span></span></span></span>）。一个重要直觉：天线是无源的，增益不是「放大」——它靠把能量从某些方向「挪」到另一些方向来获得，主瓣越窄增益越高，这把方向图、波束宽度与增益三者绑在一起。下表给出典型天线的量级感：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>天线</th>\n<th>典型增益</th>\n<th>波束宽度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>各向同性（理想）</td>\n<td>0 dBi</td>\n<td>全向</td>\n<td>理论基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半波偶极子</td>\n<td>2.15 dBi</td>\n<td>~78°</td>\n<td>全向参考天线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微带贴片</td>\n<td>6–9 dBi</td>\n<td>60°–90°</td>\n<td>定向、易集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抛物面反射面</td>\n<td>30–50 dBi</td>\n<td>&lt;1°</td>\n<td>极窄波束、远距离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"输入阻抗与带宽\">输入阻抗与带宽</h2><p>天线的输入阻抗决定它能否与馈线（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\,\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span>）匹配，进而决定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 VSWR。天线阻抗随频率变化，在谐振频率附近虚部为零、实部接近辐射电阻；偏离谐振则虚部增大、匹配恶化。把天线的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 画在<a href=\"../rf-fundamentals/smith-chart\">史密斯圆图</a>上，是一条随频率绕动的轨迹，工程师据此设计匹配网络或微调天线尺寸。带宽是天线满足某项指标（常为 VSWR&lt;2 或增益不低于某阈值）的频率范围，可用绝对带宽或相对带宽（占中心频率的百分比）表示。带宽与天线的电尺寸密切相关——天线越「电小」（相对波长越小），带宽与效率越受根本限制，这由 Chu-Harrington 极限刻画，是小型化天线（如手机内置天线）设计的天花板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"极化与极化失配\">极化与极化失配</h2><p>电磁波的极化指电场矢量随时间的取向轨迹，分为线极化（垂直/水平）、圆极化（左旋/右旋）和椭圆极化。天线只能高效收发与自身极化一致的波，极化不匹配会带来损耗。极化失配损耗在工程中是常被忽视却实实在在的预算项，下表给出几种典型组合：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发射极化</th>\n<th>接收极化</th>\n<th>失配损耗</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>垂直线</td>\n<td>垂直线</td>\n<td>0 dB（理想匹配）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>垂直线</td>\n<td>水平线</td>\n<td>理论无穷大（正交）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线极化</td>\n<td>圆极化</td>\n<td>约 3 dB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>右旋圆</td>\n<td>右旋圆</td>\n<td>0 dB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>右旋圆</td>\n<td>左旋圆</td>\n<td>理论无穷大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>圆极化在卫星通信、GNSS 中广泛使用，因为它对收发天线的相对旋转不敏感（手机怎么转都能收到 GPS），且能抑制多径中由反射造成的极化翻转。线极化失配 3 dB 这个数字会在<a href=\"../systems/link-budget-noise\">链路预算</a>里作为损耗项出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"有效面积-互易与测量\">有效面积、互易与测量</h2><p>接收时，天线从入射波中「截获」功率的能力用有效孔径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 描述，它与增益由一个普适关系联系：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_e=\\frac{\\lambda^2}{4\\pi}G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3629em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>。这个公式直接通向<a href=\"../systems/link-budget-noise\">链路预算</a>里的 Friis 传输公式，是连接「天线」与「系统」的关键纽带。天线互易定理保证同一天线收发的方向图、增益、阻抗完全相同，因此测一遍即可两用——这极大简化了设计与测量。天线参数的测量需要在消声室或紧缩场中进行，用标准增益天线作参考，2026 年毫米波天线（尤其<a href=\"antenna-types\">封装天线 AiP</a>）越来越多采用空中（OTA）测量，因为它们没有可接触的射频端口，传统 VNA 测量不再适用。理解这套参数体系，才能在面对一份天线规格书时分清哪些数字关乎匹配、哪些关乎辐射、哪些关乎系统预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>天线参数分两组：匹配类（输入阻抗、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、带宽）与辐射类（方向图、方向性、增益、极化）。</li>\n<li>增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>η</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=\\eta D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>：方向性是几何集中度，效率打折后得实际增益；无源天线靠「挪能量」获增益。</li>\n<li>带宽受电尺寸根本限制（Chu 极限），是小型化天线的天花板；阻抗轨迹在<a href=\"../rf-fundamentals/smith-chart\">史密斯圆图</a>上读。</li>\n<li>极化决定收发匹配，正交极化理论上完全失配，圆极化用于卫星/GNSS；3 dB 失配进<a href=\"../systems/link-budget-noise\">链路预算</a>。</li>\n<li>有效孔径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_e=\\frac{\\lambda^2}{4\\pi}G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3629em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 连接天线与 Friis 公式；互易性使收发参数一致；毫米波趋向 OTA 测量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"天线基本参数","id":"天线基本参数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"方向图、方向性与增益","id":"方向图-方向性与增益"},{"level":2,"text":"输入阻抗与带宽","id":"输入阻抗与带宽"},{"level":2,"text":"极化与极化失配","id":"极化与极化失配"},{"level":2,"text":"有效面积、互易与测量","id":"有效面积-互易与测量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"射频滤波器设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/rf-circuits/filter-design"},"next":{"title":"常见天线类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/rf-antenna-design/antennas/antenna-types"}}